            2162                     !   Lang, S., W.-K. Tao, R. Cifelli, W. Olson, J. Halverson, S.           c
            2163                     !   Rutledge, and J. Simpson, 2007: Improving simulations of              c
            2164                     !   convective system from TRMM LBA: Easterly and Westerly regimes.       c
            2165                     !   J. Atmos. Sci., 64, 1141-1164.                                        c
