            2173                     !   Simulated Radar Reflectivities from a Bulk Microphysics Scheme:       c
            2174                     !   Tropical Convective Systems. J. Atmos. Sci., 68, 2306-2320.           c
            2175                     !                                                                         c
            2176                     !   Shi, J. J., T. Matsui, W.-K. Tao, C. Peters-Lidard, M. Chin, Q. Tan,  c
            2177                     !   K. Pickering, N. Guy, S. Lang, and E. Kemp., 2014: Implementation of  c
            2178                     !   an Aerosol-Cloud Microphysics-Radiation Coupling into the NASA        c
            2179                     !   Unified WRF:  Simulation Results for the 6-7 August 2006 AMMA Special c
            2180                     !   Observing Period. Quart. J. Roy. Meteor. Soc., 140, 2158-2175,        c
            2181                     !   doi:10.1002/qj.2286.                                                  c
            2182                     !                                                                         c
            2183                     !   Stephen E. Lang, Wei-Kuo Tao, Jiun-Dar Chern, Di Wu,                  c
            2184                     !   and Xiaowen Li, 2014: Benefits of a Fourth Ice Class                  c
            2185                     !   in the Simulated Radar Reflectivities of Convective Systems           c
            2186                     !   Using a Bulk Microphysics Scheme. J. Atmos. Sci., 71, 3583-3612.      c
            2187                     !   doi: http://dx.doi.org/10.1175/JAS-D-13-0330.1                        c
