            2191                     !   of convective systems using a bulk microphysics scheme.  J. Atmos.    c
            2192                     !   Sci., 71, 3583-3612. doi: http://dx.doi.org/10.1175/JAS-D-13-0330.1   c
            2193                     !                                                                         c
            2194                     !   Tao, W.-K., D. Wu, S. Lang, J.-D. Chern, C. Peters-Lidard,            c
            2195                     !   A. Fridlind, and T. Matsui (2016), High-resolution NU-WRF             c
            2196                     !   simulations of a deep convective-precipitation system during          c
            2197                     !   MC3E: Further improvements and comparisons between Goddard            c
            2198                     !   microphysics schemes and observations, J. Geophys. Res. Atmos.,       c
