            3528     4   m    s                 phfr(i)=r2ih*max(r18r(i)*(y1(i)-1.)*temp, 0.0)
            3529     4               !           phfr(i)=r2ih*max(r18r(i)*(y1(i)-1.)/zr(i)**7., 0.0)
            3530     4   s    s                else
