            3676     3   s    s                 Y3(i)=.78/ZH(i)**2+h19aq(i)*SCV(i)/ZH(i)**BHH5
            3677     3   s    s                 DDa0(i)=h19rt(i)*Y1(i)*Y3(i)*ftnh(i)+r19at*TAIRC(i)*  &
            3678     3                            (QHACW(i)+QHACR(i))
